{"uid":"lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py","name":"orchestrator.py","qualname":"lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py","kind":"module","file":"lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py","line":1,"end_line":273,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"Orchestrator REST + web panel for the LazyOwn C2 dashboard.","description":"Exposes the autonomous-loop administration contract over HTTP so a\nremote operator or the web panel sees the same truth as the shell and\nthe Textual console:\n\n- ``GET /api/v1/orchestrator/status`` — world model, kill chain, verbs,\n  triggers and stage view in one call;\n- ``GET /api/v1/orchestrator/world`` — raw world model + kill chain;\n- ``GET /api/v1/orchestrator/verbs`` — verb catalog with optional search;\n- ``POST /api/v1/orchestrator/verbs/toggle`` — flip one catalog verb;\n- ``POST /api/v1/orchestrator/stages/toggle`` — flip one loop stage;\n- ``GET/POST /api/v1/orchestrator/triggers`` — list / add triggers;\n- ``GET /api/v1/orchestrator/triggers/seed`` — re-merge the YAML seeds;\n- ``DELETE /api/v1/orchestrator/triggers/<id>`` — remove one trigger.\n\nX-API-Key guards every route (same store as the rest of ``/api/v1``).\nThe panel route reuses the dashboard session login instead.\n\nDesign (SOLID): Single Responsibility — HTTP adaptation only, no domain\nlogic; Open/Closed — new layers append one helper; Dependency Inversion\n— domain contracts are imported lazily at call time so partial installs\ndegrade to JSON errors instead of crashing the whole service.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::BODY_NAME_REQUIRED","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::status","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::world","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::verbs","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::verbs_toggle","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::stages_toggle","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::stage_names","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::triggers","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::triggers_add","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::triggers_seed","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::triggers_delete","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::panel","lazyc2/blueprints/orchestrator.py::panel_json"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
